In the provided C# code, `_size` represents the size of the ArrayList, while `ret_value` represents the value that is returned from the `RemoveAt` method. After removing an element from the ArrayList (which decreases the size), the `RemoveAt` method returns the removed value. So, the assertion will ensure that the previous size of the ArrayList equals the current size less the returned value after the removal.--------------------
